  "prepAhead": [
    "Cut the chicken into pieces up to a day ahead; keep covered in the fridge.",
    "Mix the honey garlic sauce (without the cornstarch slurry) and refrigerate up to 3 days.",
    "Cook the rice the day before — it reheats perfectly."
  ],
  "reheat": "Air fryer 175°C (350°F) for 3–4 minutes to bring the crunch back, or oven 190°C (375°F) for 8–10 min. Microwave the rice and broccoli with a damp paper towel. Reheat to 74°C (165°F)."
